{"candidateAnswer":"It showed the deep bond between them","evidence":"[D15:20 | 7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023] Jolene: I have lots of great memories, like our little 'snake adventure'. She got out and I spent hours searching, so relieved when I finally found her snuggling under the bed. It really showed how much I love her.","itemId":"urn:uuid:58f40f83-f29e-5948-87cc-8f8444d91bc8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c811580a7f8023533f3fe72bb9ed7d829fb4509298db118092013587d38f7033","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How does Jolene describe the feeling of finding her snake snuggled under the bed after it got out?","referenceAnswer":"It really showed how much she loves her.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c811580a7f8023533f3fe72bb9ed7d829fb4509298db118092013587d38f7033"}}]}